WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.252 --> 00:00:03.837
- Robert DuBois.

00:00:04.254 --> 00:00:05.839
He's in prison
for putting Superman

00:00:05.839 --> 00:00:07.883
in the ICU
with a kryptonite bullet.

00:00:07.883 --> 00:00:10.719
- I'm not joining
your Suicide Squad.

00:00:10.719 --> 00:00:11.637
- We'll see.

00:00:12.638 --> 00:00:14.348
- My court date is coming up,

00:00:14.348 --> 00:00:16.433
and Miss Waller said maybe
you could help me out.

00:00:16.850 --> 00:00:18.477
- You're threatening
my daughter!

00:00:18.477 --> 00:00:20.103
- Everyone stand down.
- Miss Waller, I don't--

00:00:20.103 --> 00:00:21.063
- Stand down!

00:00:24.983 --> 00:00:26.985
I wouldn't take
such extreme measures

00:00:26.985 --> 00:00:28.904
if this mission weren't
more important

00:00:28.904 --> 00:00:30.948
than you
could possibly imagine.

00:00:30.948 --> 00:00:33.033
Are you in or out?

00:00:33.867 --> 00:00:35.702
Good.
Let's meet your team.

00:00:39.373 --> 00:00:41.708
Each member is chosen
for his or her own

00:00:41.708 --> 00:00:43.418
completely unique set
of abilities.

00:00:43.502 --> 00:00:44.711
- [scoffs]

00:00:50.050 --> 00:00:51.260
- Hey, guys. Sorry I'm late.

00:00:51.260 --> 00:00:53.136
Had to go number two.
- Good to know.

00:00:55.055 --> 00:00:56.473
- Is this thing a dog?

00:00:56.473 --> 00:00:57.724
- A dog?

00:00:57.724 --> 00:00:59.309
What kind of dog do you
think it is, mate?

00:00:59.309 --> 00:01:00.769
- I'm gonna go with
Afghan hound.

00:01:00.769 --> 00:01:02.688
- Oh, my God!
Is it a werewolf?

00:01:02.688 --> 00:01:04.106
- Yo, they sat me next
to a werewolf?

00:01:04.106 --> 00:01:05.607
Yo, let me out!
- Hey, hey, hey!

00:01:05.607 --> 00:01:06.733
He's not a werewolf, okay?

00:01:06.733 --> 00:01:08.235
He's a weasel.
He's harmless.

00:01:08.235 --> 00:01:10.988
I mean, he's not harmless.
He's killed 27 children,

00:01:10.988 --> 00:01:12.698
but, you know...

00:01:16.451 --> 00:01:18.203
- Your mission

00:01:18.203 --> 00:01:20.163
is to destroy
every trace of something

00:01:20.163 --> 00:01:23.750
known only as Project Starfish.

00:01:23.750 --> 00:01:25.627
Any questions?

00:01:25.627 --> 00:01:28.463
- "Starfish" is a slang term
for a butthole.

00:01:28.463 --> 00:01:29.673
Think there's any connection?

00:01:31.884 --> 00:01:33.552
- No.

00:01:33.552 --> 00:01:34.386
- "No."

00:01:37.097 --> 00:01:38.348
- All right.

00:01:39.057 --> 00:01:40.309
Let's get it.

00:01:41.476 --> 00:01:43.061
- [roars]

00:01:43.061 --> 00:01:45.189
- This is suicide.
- Well, that's kinda our thing.

00:01:45.189 --> 00:01:47.441
- I'm a superhero!

00:01:58.285 --> 00:01:59.244
- That's my dad.

00:02:00.120 --> 00:02:01.538
- I'm gonna get you
out of here alive.

00:02:01.538 --> 00:02:03.916
- I'm going to get you
out of here alive.

00:02:16.720 --> 00:02:18.138
- Ratatouille,
what do you got?

00:02:18.138 --> 00:02:20.265
- Bird.
- [pigeon coos]

00:02:20.265 --> 00:02:22.309
- Nanaue! Stay off the comm.

